OL,3,GNEWSAPrime Minister swaps dispatch box
OL,4,Afor Gogglebox
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is to appear in a special
OL,7,Fedition of Channel 4 hit show
OL,8,FGogglebox.
OL,10,FThe prime minister will be joined by
OL,11,FLiverpool City Region Mayor Steve
OL,12,FRotheram for a celebrity edition of the
OL,13,Fprogramme in support of Stand Up 4
OL,14,FCancer, the campaign the broadcaster
OL,15,Fruns with charity Cancer Research UK.
OL,17,FRotheram said he was a huge supporter
OL,18,Fof the cause, but had also agreed to
OL,19,Ftake part because he did not want his
OL,20,Ffriend to end up looking like "Billy
OL,21,FNo-Mates" on the Downing Street sofa
OL,22,Falone.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
